# Systemd Service for Audio Level Enforcer

Place in: ~/.config/systemd/user/audio-enforcer.service

```ini
[Unit]
Description=VLC Audio Level Enforcer - Fixed -2.0dB
After=pipewire.service
Requires=pipewire.service

[Service]
Type=simple
ExecStart=/usr/bin/python3 /home/alca/.local/bin/audio-level-enforcer.py --daemon
Restart=always
RestartSec=5

[Install]
WantedBy=default.target
```

CRITICAL: Use ABSOLUTE path for ExecStart. Mixing %h with ~ creates broken paths like /home/alca/~/.local/bin/…